# Findings accepted on purpose. Each entry needs a reason.

# AVD-AWS-0132: S3 buckets use S3-managed encryption (SSE-S3, AES-256) instead of a customer
# managed KMS key. The demo holds fake data only; a KMS key adds a monthly cost and extra
# permissions for the backup user. Revisit with the production ADR (section 12 of the spec).
AVD-AWS-0132
